    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1027">

                <pb facs="0896" n="780" xml:id="pg780"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17036.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 31, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Obregon will cross to Juarez tonight and go south early Saturday morning. He
                    informs me that most of the men of Villa and Rodriguez have surrendered but that
                    Villa and Rodriguez have so far escaped plan for their capture.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
